=== layout: one-panel

# Update the Distances

@body

Average the original distances between genes in the two clusters.

- ac to b: (12 + 10) / 2 = 11
- ac to d: (15 + 13) / 2 = 14
- ac to e: (9 + 9) / 2 = 9
- ac to f: (18 + 14) / 2 = 16

